Keep a shared order as empty text.
Keep a shared words as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared wanted as empty text.
Keep a shared rankanswer as 0.
Keep a shared sorted as 0.
Keep a shared lengths as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared offsets as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared ranks as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place "hlabcdefgijkmnopqrstuvwxyz" into order.
Place "hello" into words.
Place "leetcode" into words.
Set sorted to 1.

To rank from place (a whole number).
If place is more than 25, return.
The piece is the slice of order from place to place plus 1.
If piece matches wanted, set rankanswer to place, return.
Rank from place plus 1.

The at is 0.
For each entry in words.
Place at into offsets.
The end is the last position of entry.
The size is end plus 1.
Place size into lengths.
For every spot from 0 to size minus 1.
Set wanted to the slice of entry from spot to spot plus 1.
Rank from 0.
Place rankanswer into ranks.
Add 1 to at.

To verify with pair (a whole number).
The firststart is item pair of offsets.
The secondstart is item (pair plus 1) of offsets.
The limit is item pair of lengths.
If item (pair plus 1) of lengths is less than limit, set limit to item (pair plus 1) of lengths.
The decided is 0.
For every spot from 0 to limit minus 1.
The leftrank is item (firststart plus spot) of ranks.
The rightrank is item (secondstart plus spot) of ranks.
If leftrank is less than rightrank, set decided to 1.
If leftrank is more than rightrank, set decided to 2, set sorted to 0.
If decided is not 0, stop.
If decided is 0 and item pair of lengths is more than item (pair plus 1) of lengths, set sorted to 0.

The last is the last position of words.
The finalpair is last minus 1.
For every pair from 0 to finalpair.
Verify with pair.

If sorted is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
